+
+The authenticated integration test then:
+
+1. created a dinner shift plan with the current top three priorities
+2. posted a closing handoff
+3. completed the shift closeout
+4. reloaded the operating rhythm
+
+Final rhythm completion:
+
+`100%`
+
+The closeout correctly reported:
+
+`closed-clean`
+
+for the isolated integration state because there were no active carryover actions.
+
+## API
+
+### GET
+`/api/manager-operating-rhythm?locationId=<location>`
+
+### POST
+`/api/manager-operating-rhythm/plan`
+
+### POST
+`/api/manager-operating-rhythm/handoff`
+
+### POST
+`/api/manager-operating-rhythm/closeout`
+
+All endpoints require authentication. Writes require write/admin permission.
+
+## Safety
+
+Policy remains:
+
+- `humanOwned: true`
+- `automaticExecution: false`
+- `continuousShiftRecord: true`
+
+Blue Current assembles, recommends, and measures the shift. Managers still make the operating commitments and closeout decisions.
